@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title UC05 - Prepare a reviewed migration
actor Administrator
participant "Migration form" as UI
participant migration_planner as Planner
participant plan_selection as Selection
participant plan_resolution as Resolution
participant "placement / copy_decision" as Rules
database "Plan / targets / operations" as DB
Administrator -> UI : Capture filters / folder rows / conflict choices
UI -> Planner : preview(..., options)
Planner -> Rules : Pair courses and resolve folder correspondences
Rules --> Planner : Existing target or reviewed creation descriptor
Planner -> Rules : Copy / skip / overwrite / blocker
Planner -> DB : Immutable operations, targets and digest
Planner --> UI : Paged course / folder / file review
Administrator -> UI : Select course, folder or individual files
UI -> Selection : save reviewed inclusion action
Selection -> DB : Whole-group inclusions / digest / log
Selection --> UI : Small state response; preserve visible nodes
opt Resolve a placement or content conflict
  Administrator -> UI : Choose destination / creation / overwrite / exclusion
  UI -> Resolution : apply(planid, digest, choice)
  Resolution -> Planner : preview with explicit choice and saved exclusions
  Planner -> DB : New plan; retain original review
  Planner --> UI : Updated review and persistent Continue state
end
note over UI, DB : All matches are prepared; only the current page is rendered.
@enduml
